<title>INDIA: BADMINTON-INDIAN OPEN FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-INDIAN OPEN FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals at the Indian</p>
<p>Open Grand Prix series badminton championships on Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>3-Heryanto Arbi (Indonesia) beat Pullela Gopichand (India) 15-4</p>
<p>15-7</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>2-Ade Lucas/Adar Sutrisna (Indonesia) beat 1-Hadi Sugiarto/Aras</p>
<p>Razak (Indonesia) 15-5 15-12</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>1-Cindana Hartono (Indonesia) beat Lee Soon-deuk (South Korea)</p>
<p>11-6 11-7</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>2-Cynthia/Etty Tantri (Indonesia) beat Lee Soon-deuk/Choi</p>
<p>Ma-ree (South Korea) 15-8 14-17 15-5</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>1-Imar Tohari/Ema Ernawati (Indonesia) beat Lee Chee Leong/Lee</p>
<p>Yin Yin (Malaysia) 15-3 15-9</p>
</text>
